      "text": "Because PR-Agent makes single-shot model calls with no tool-use loop, the agent-skills progressive-disclosure model is not implementable; all enabled skill text is loaded into every prompt (bounded by max_skills_tokens), and skills needing script execution or binary assets will not work."
